// The Boyle party guard (`DishonoredSpawner_46`, yaw 251.4) sees the player standing 600 uu in
// front of it, while it plays the ambient idle `Empty_Idle_03` (the variant is pinned: `ambient`).
//
// Original capture (`probe_launch scenario`, `Bones("guard", ["+world"])` + `AnimState("guard")`; the
// numbers below are read from that trace, the camera_jnt pose from its anim sidecar):
// * the player is in the inner cone from the first tick: the seen value rises at 0.692 / s (the
//   norm 591 / 3500 = 0.169), level 1 (HeadTrack) at tick 22, Busted at tick 87 (the value goes on
//   rising past 1: the accumulator has no upper bound, its max is FLT_MAX);
// * ticks 97-124 are an outer-cone window (0.246 / s, the norm 597 / 1700 = 0.351): the ambient idle
//   pitches the head up to +20 deg, the target (the point of the player's vision segment where
//   `eye up . (point - eye) = 0`, clamped to it: stealth.md section 17) falls out of the inner
//   cone. The window's edges are sampled by the target's line-of-sight check (every 0.1 s, held in
//   between), so they move by a few ticks from one capture to the next (97-124 here, 98-125 in the
//   first capture of this setup); only the rate inside the window is checked.
//
// The guard's look-at is disabled while the ambient idle plays (`DisNotify_NPCDisableLookAt`), so the
// vision axis is the animated `camera_jnt` bone, not the body (stealth.md F4 / sections 13, 16, 17).
//
// Dropped: the earlier numbers (outer-cone first sighting 0.353 at 0.339 / s, level 1 at 0.75 s,
// Busted at 1.85 s, ORACLE.md 2026-10-08 "Capture requests answered") came from an earlier session run
// that is not in the cached capture of this setup (nor of any re-capture); that run's head was in
// another ambient idle (or none), so its numbers described another setup. They were never reproducible
// and were removed rather than re-fitted.
(
    name: "stealth/detect_600",
    system: Stealth,
    map: "L_Boyle_Ext_P",
    description: "Stand 600 uu in front of the party guard playing an ambient idle: inner-cone rate, time to the first attention level and to Busted, the outer-cone window.",
    setup: (
        player: Some((position: (-3201.5, -2763.3, 20), yaw: 71.37, snap_to_floor: true)),
        npcs: [(id: Some("guard"), spawner: Some("DishonoredSpawner_46"), yaw: 251.37, state: Some("Idle"), ambient: Some("Empty_Idle_03"), ambient_age: 0.067)],
        settle: 1,
    ),
    ticks: 130,
    input: [],
    checkpoints: [
        (name: "inner-cone rate", expect: [(metric: Delta("npc.guard.attn", 5, 35), value: 0.3443, tol: 0.01, source: "capture ab418571e9108fda: value 0.0596 at tick 5, 0.4039 at tick 35 (0.688 / s, inner cone 591 / 3500)", status: Measured)]),
        (name: "notices", expect: [(metric: TimeToReach("npc.guard.attn_level", 1), value: 0.3667, tol: 0.02, source: "capture ab418571e9108fda: attention level 1 at tick 22", status: Measured)]),
        (name: "busted", expect: [(metric: TimeToReach("npc.guard.attn_level", 4), value: 1.45, tol: 0.02, source: "capture ab418571e9108fda: attention level 4 at tick 87", status: Measured)]),
        (name: "outer-cone window rate", expect: [(metric: Delta("npc.guard.attn", 100, 120), value: 0.0820, tol: 0.006, source: "capture ab418571e9108fda: value 1.1244 at tick 100, 1.2064 at tick 120 (0.246 / s, outer cone 597 / 1700)", status: Measured)]),
        (name: "LOS norm (inner cone)", expect: [(metric: At("npc.guard.los", 10), value: 0.169, tol: 0.01, source: "derived from the capture's rate 0.692 / s: 591 / 3500 (the original trace has no LOS channel)", status: Unverified)]),
        (name: "LOS norm (outer-cone window)", expect: [(metric: At("npc.guard.los", 110), value: 0.351, tol: 0.015, source: "derived from the capture's window rate 0.246 / s: 597 / 1700 (the original trace has no LOS channel)", status: Unverified)]),
    ],
    record: [Pawn, Npc("guard"), Bones("guard", ["+world"]), AnimState("guard")],
    capture: Some("captured 2026-10-08 with Bones / AnimState and the ambient idle pinned (Empty_Idle_03: the rand() call at 0x00B39728 replaced by the index); trace ab418571e9108fda"),
)
